  "pubDate": "Sat, 01 Mar 2025 15:40:43 GMT",
  "description": "<p></p><p>This week is the end of Unity pathway course. Finally, I finished the last two AR courses. Marker and plane. Marker is to show the 3D object on a graphic image. Plane is to show the 3D object on a plane surface. I tried them with my old Mix2s. It rendered not so acceptable but you still can make some projects. For example, the 3D object cannot follow the marker in every frame. You can feel a little lag. The plane tutorial mentioned stencil shader in the portal. It is harder to learn and since it didn’t mention a lot I will return to it later.</p><p>Also, the tutorial mentioned visual scripting, it was written in 2022. Back then non-code was a popular idea. But now, it seems that the LLM made a huge effect on the industry. I think the visual scripting will be less popular in a while.</p><p>During the course, I collected some good unity courses.</p><p><a href=\"https://learn.unity.com/project/john-lemon-s-haunted-jaunt-3d-beginner?uv=2020.3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\">John Lemon’s Haunted Jaunt: 3D Beginner</a></p><p><a href=\"https://learn.unity.com/course/practical-game-accessibility\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\">Practical Game Accessibility</a></p><p><a href=\"https://learn.unity.com/project/vr-beginner-the-escape-room\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\">VR Beginner: The Escape Room</a></p><p>Here are some <a href=\"https://docs.unity3d.com/Manual/best-practice-guides.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\">Unity best practices</a>. I think I will read them next week.</p><p>This is an animation by adult swim. I only watched half of the season. But it is good to watch.</p><p>Unity best practicesCommon side effects</p>",
